### META
directory_path: services/_example
description: Example service template demonstrating canonical DINS service structure per PART 9
created: 2025-11-29
modified: 2025-11-29
status: template

### PURPOSE
This is a TEMPLATE service - not deployable.
Copy this directory to create new services.

### FILES
service.yaml | Service descriptor - defines name, type, image, runtime, secrets
Dockerfile | Container build file for local-build mode

### DIRECTORIES
src/ | Source code directory
config/ | Default configuration templates (non-secret)
docs/ | Service documentation
tests/ | Service-specific tests

### REQUIRED_FOR_NEW_SERVICE
1. service.yaml (always required)
2. Dockerfile (if image.mode: local-build)
3. docs/README.md (recommended)

### COPY_TO_CREATE_SERVICE
cp -r services/_example services/<new-service-name>
